SUMMARY:Free Food @ Beyond Labels
DESCRIPTION:Join Pride at the Multicultural Center for a night to learn about intersectionality and the members of our community who are often forgotten about. We will participate in various activities to understand our identities more, and some resources to find more information will be provided.
LOCATION:Multicultural Center
END:VEVENT
